OnePlus 13 / PJZ110 POSIX CPU timer UAF adaptation
Copyright 2026 the adaptation contributors

This product includes software derived from the Android timer port published by
zjns (MIT), which in turn derives from woshigenm's original Android port and from
the ghostlock-app KernelSU late-load stage.

The upstream work was modified for the exact OnePlus 13 (PJZ110) build listed in
profiles/pjz110/. Exact provenance is recorded in src/timer.c (file header) and
in README.md.

No OnePlus firmware, boot image, raw kernel Image, private key, account token or
device-unique secret is included.
